=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# environment item1-doas-rule ----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decision 1 (b), not recommended: item 1 on alpine324-rule$
# writes a rule for alice, permit persist setenv { HARDN_CONFIG$
# } alice, and says first that it grants alice doas. Its plan is$
# lockout-risk (sudoers.RiskLockout: a grant that asks a$
# password), so it is confirmed by typing the hostname.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under doas           Not kept$
   -  Value                Not set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under doas           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]:$
$
# Warning$
# The rule also lets alice use doas, in wheel or not.$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [+] Under doas           Kept$
$
$

